Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然平常有点好色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是其实背负着破除风穴诅咒的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而一直以来都在追杀奈落的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是感觉到和那个人一样的寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:32.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:36.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:40.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:57.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.42,0:01:02.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:06.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:10.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:14.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:18.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:22.74,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:26.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:33.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:38.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:46.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:30.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概在大雪中迷路了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:44.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫做小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸他发生什么事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸他…已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有可以收容我的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没地方去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就到我家来住吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小雪的肌肤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像雪一样洁白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个好美丽的姑娘呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:17.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你干嘛突然打我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在帮你打蚊子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我之后得修行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以就没什么其它特别的事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你跟那个女的后来怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟她没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一转眼就过了七年了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我还是个乳臭未干的小朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 打中了吧 哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第101话 七年之后 一场令人怀念的大雪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你振作点啊 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快睁开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可千万不能死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要坚强一点哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个季节怎么会有雪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话 能够告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是法师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:28.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近附近经常有雪怪出现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村里已经有好几个壮丁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他这样子突然之间…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你立刻赶去约定会面的小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:35.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这件事告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了阻止妖怪再出来害人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先去收拾她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这妖气不是太重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位法师看起来这么年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会出事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过说起来这个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是个皮肤雪白的绝色美女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:05:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎每个男人看到她就迷得晕头转向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上跟着她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子这里恐怕也查不到奈落的线索了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚整理背包时 从里面翻出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:19.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来想要带来可以跟大家一起玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果没想到居然给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得是不是受潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先来试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:30.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇 这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做烟火哦！烟火
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:36.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唔喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这种时候下雪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 弥勒法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:09.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.51,0:06:20.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位旅者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是在大雪中遇到麻烦了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问有什么我可以帮忙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 这位姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你可不可以帮我生个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子已经生下了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请去抱抱他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去抱抱我们的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正所谓无功者饭菜不留嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那几个坏蛋不必留给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇 看起来真好吃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是闻到香味才跑回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.87,0:07:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别胡说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不是因为突然下雪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 怪不得觉得这么冷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚跟弥勒法师呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 他们还没回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过不了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子饿了自然就会回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我跟云母的鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别说那么小器的话嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇快过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 珊瑚 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有经过你们的同意就自己进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:02.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不要紧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.41,0:08:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且外面的雪下得那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们来吃点野猪肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 这真的很好吃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:09.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是生的耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫报应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看 在雪女还没离开之前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好还是先待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪女？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种天气只要有个年轻的男人在路上走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会被一个年轻的姑娘叫住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷迷糊糊的跟着姑娘走之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天就往往会被人发现已经冻死在雪地里了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说这个小姑娘一身肌肤像雪一样白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.61,0:08:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个样子美若天仙的女人哩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:41.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都说宁可被冻死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也要想办法见她一面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下弥勒法师危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚也跟他在一起不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 那大概不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的一点都不了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:09:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看弥勒法师绝对不会放过那个姑娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候要是珊瑚突然出现的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种情景真不敢想象
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候珊瑚一定会宰了弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的话以前不知道说过多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是不开窍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个雪女也是在奈落下落不明的时候才现身
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么说她都是只妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就绝对不能够放着不管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去看看马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 我跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:30.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你们拿去带在身上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是回魂汤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊 大家快来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:09:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 喝这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是回魂汤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得身体冰冷的时候 听说喝这个最有效了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:11.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这好像有效哎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说这是酒精浓度特别高的烧酒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上蝮蛇、蝾螈还有毛毛虫浸泡而成的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.22,0:10:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 她好像恢复精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子已经生下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请去抱抱他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去抱抱我们的宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一家三口一定正开心的享受天伦之乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:52.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.15,0:11:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 一起进去吧 相公
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个女人并不是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么要出来到处害人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样抓男人回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就是为了要吸收男人身上的精气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这些是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相公 就是这些孩子啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先进去熬点米汤给孩子们喝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:35.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:38.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尿布就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经忘得一干二净了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们全都是我帮你生的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都…都是我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还这么多？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我亲耳听见的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是法师亲生的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 这小子也到了该纳税的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能这么定下来也是件好事不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:18.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪随便说几句你们别全当真嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖气是从里面传出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上破了这个结界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好…乖乖啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好…乖乖啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！别把鼻涕擤在我的衣服上啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊！我的锡杖不是你们的玩具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:12:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.91,0:13:00.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.01,0:13:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我喂与作喝点米汤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有舍松的尿布湿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:06.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有待会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要唱歌给小虎听
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哄他乖乖睡觉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:10.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 马上去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 乖乖啦 别再哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 好不好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 马上帮你换尿布哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小宝宝快睡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以在那边尿尿啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.93,0:13:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.93,0:13:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厕所在这边嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你一个人照顾他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:38.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为母亲 谁不会亲自照顾孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:41.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多孩子 难道全都是我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些孩子的家都被战火烧毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一个一生下来就不得不离开他们的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经常捡这些孩子回来照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久而久之就变成了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:57.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是…辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们几个全都是可怜的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这好像是… 弥勒法师的歌声喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:19.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么不负责任的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他也懂得疼自己的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:27.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有间大屋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡得好熟喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:39.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖…乖…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是乖宝宝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要赶快健康长大哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 好乖 好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖 好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子弥勒法师中了幻术了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快醒醒吧 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖…乖…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:07.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面几位来者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不准通行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 雪豹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要勉强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天气这么冷 四肢当然不容易伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我打倒他们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把四魂之玉碎片抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪 今天让我来收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到这家伙这么不堪一击
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呀啊 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖哦 乖乖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面好像有点吵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群野狗在雪地迷了路了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不必担心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上派人把它们赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.99,0:16:50.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝们…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:16:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快醒醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就很清醒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.73,0:17:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己仔细看看 这也叫清醒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…这些是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天休想逃离这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你长得和那个人那么像
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我所认识的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以其实我也不想对你这么的粗鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:29.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿呀 怎么这么不顺利啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好快哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然让它闪开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恨…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恨了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明心地那么的善良
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么偏偏要诱捕那些男人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且加害他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恨…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.09,0:18:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界太可恨了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:09.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨我自己活在这个世上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:17.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下屠刀才能够立地成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么突然变成这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用热
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们最怕热气跟火了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那就看我的狐火
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不管用嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以利用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:18:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我陪你过两招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:02.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是另一只雪怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信刚刚那个雪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:57.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没有附身在这个灵魂上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个灵魂属于一个被卷入战争
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且丢了性命的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 她一直在寻找那些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因不幸而离开人世的那些小孩的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至一直照顾着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.11,0:20:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信这个女人的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.11,0:20:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被雪怪给控制住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是哀伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想战国时代的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该活得很艰辛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.69,0:20:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话又说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始当她告诉你替你生了孩子的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:50.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么想都不想就相信了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是有做过什么见不得人的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:20:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.87,0:21:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师是为了帮助可怜的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.31,0:21:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会故意假装中计吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.31,0:21:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为法师怎么可能会犯下这种错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:14.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是一只蚊子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该继续上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那位姑娘真的好像喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那天帮助年纪还小的我的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位小雪姑娘…一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在世界的某个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.81,0:21:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过着幸福快乐的日子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:00.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是残雪…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:15.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:24.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:34.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:44.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.81,0:22:48.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:53.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:23:01.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:07.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:12.26,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.57,0:23:19.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:29.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.69,0:23:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落消失之后 首次发现行踪的地方是北方山脉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盘踞那块地方的妖狼族突然被人袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.63,0:23:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击他们的是拥有四魂之玉碎片的恶鬼「凶骨」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:23:59.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.47,0:24:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道从坟墓里复活了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:04.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便把你身上的四魂之玉碎片交出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.14,0:24:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们既不是人类也不是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.48,0:24:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些复苏的亡灵到底有何目的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.71,0:24:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被亡魂袭击的妖狼族
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.48,0:24:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别神气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让我帮兄弟们报仇再说
